[Trigger]
Name	ascent
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Highcairn is a mountain of old graves, master, and Warden Hilde Cairn has made her hold at the top of it. Four terraces and three switchbacks lie between you and her.
Action	objective	1	Kill Warden Hilde Cairn in the mountain hold.
Action	objective	1	Climb the terraces, one switchback at a time.
Action	objective	1	Keep your heart standing against the cairn patrols.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstSeams
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	400
Action	message	1	The first seams are open. Gold buys you more than rooms: build a bridge and a door or two.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	terrace1
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Terrace1
Action	message	1	The first terrace. The lava seam across it can be crossed on the stone bridge in the middle.
Action	reveal	1	LavaCross
Action	reveal	1	Caldera
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	calderaSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Caldera
Action	message	1	A hot basin of lava with gold in its walls. Hold it and you can feed your army without climbing.
Action	gold	1	400
Action	terrain	53	64	53	64	manawell
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	terrace2
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Terrace2
Action	message	1	The second terrace and the watch of the cairn patrols. A ramp at the east end leads up.
Action	reveal	1	Terrace3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	terrace3
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Terrace3
Action	message	1	The third terrace. The mountain is quiet here, and the hold above is waking up.
Action	reveal	1	Terrace4
Action	reveal	1	SealedCairn
Action	spawn	3	62	21	1	Knight:3	Elf:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	terrace4
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Terrace4
Action	message	1	The last terrace. The hold lies behind a stopped passage. The warden has seen you and sounds the alarm.
Action	reveal	1	Hold
Action	reveal	1	Basin
Action	spawn	3	36	14	1	Knight:3	Dwarf2:3	Monk:3	Elf:3
Action	objective	1	Break into the hold and strike down the warden.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cairnStone
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	stonecreate	5	21
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sealedFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	CairnHall
Action	message	1	A cairn at the end of the third terrace has been bricked in, and a hidden hall lies behind it. A pale stone rests on a plinth, and a bound cairn spirit rises beside it and takes the stone up. Carry it home to your own heart.
Action	spawn	1	5	22	1	Spider:3@CairnBearer
Action	stoneattach	CairnBearer
Action	setflag	bearerOut	1
Action	objective	1	Bring the cairn spirit with the pale stone to your dungeon heart.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	stoneHome
Mode	once
Cond	reached	CairnBearer	heart	1
Action	message	1	The pale stone has reached your heart and a hidden land has opened.
Action	setflag	stoneDone	1
Action	discover	campaign/SkittleCavern.level
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bearerLost
Mode	once
Cond	flag	bearerOut	1
Cond	flag	stoneDone	0
Cond	alive	CairnBearer	0
Action	message	1	The cairn spirit has fallen. Another one rises from the plinth to carry the stone.
Action	spawn	1	5	22	1	Spider:3@CairnBearer2
Action	stoneattach	CairnBearer2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
